{
  "schema": "pd2.test.mod_manifest_cases.v1",
  "about": [
    "Shared verdict table for root mod.json admission.",
    "offline = validate_manifest() in tools/verify_pdxxx_modder_workflow.py.",
    "game = modManifestValidateBytes() in port/src/mod_manifest_validate.cpp.",
    "Verdicts: ok, unreadable, not_object, or field:<failing fields in id,name,version order>.",
    "A case gives its payload as text (UTF-8) or as hex (raw bytes).",
    "Where the columns differ, stricter says why. The game may refuse what offline accepts, never the reverse."
  ],
